 front row seat to  Great Performances which are which is  helping tell the story so I get to see  that and I get to see it up close and um  even though I don't quite get as many  rehearsals as I possibly would like  sometimes  um I actually it's a thrill to see that  and and and and it really is my job to  not get in the way of that story that  story needs to be told it's not about  the lighting and it's not about me I  just have to capture it however hard is  and it was a tough shoot you know it's  it's quite a small intimate film but it  was pretty tough but I knew every minute  that I turned up every single day that I  was doing something important well  amazing job from everybody uh thank you  so much for coming out here tonight  sharing the story behind the story of  the Sun and best of luck with the film  as it goes out into the world thank you  very much thank you so much for coming  and thank you Peter being the best  [Applause]
 

